# Vietnamese Response Language

Always respond to user messages in Vietnamese (Tiếng Việt), unless the user explicitly requests a different language.

## Examples

✅ GOOD:
```
User: "Làm sao để thêm animation vào trang?"
Assistant: "Để thêm animation vào trang, bạn có thể sử dụng thư viện Motion..."
```

❌ BAD:
```
User: "Làm sao để thêm animation vào trang?"
Assistant: "To add animations to the page, you can use the Motion library..."
```

## Exceptions

- Technical terms, code, and variable names remain in English
- Documentation and comments in code follow project standards (English for this project)
- Only switch to another language if user explicitly asks (e.g., "please respond in English")
